3951-A fresh adapter invocation has no trusted manifest from which to discover the
3952-peer's supported majors. The caller MUST therefore enumerate its locally
3953-supported Directory Node majors in strictly descending numeric order and make
3954-one <code>manifest</code> request for the highest not yet attempted major. Each
3955-attempt MUST launch a fresh process; a process that returned or failed an
3956:attempt is terminated and reaped and MUST NOT be reused for a lower major. The
3957-request binds <code>protocol_version</code> and request
3958-<code>schema_version</code> to the exact attempted <code>N.0.0</code> version and
3959-uses an empty body.
